<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Texas Utilities upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Texas Utilities upgraded.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>HSBC James Capel said analyst Daniel Ford upgraded Texas Utilities Co to buy from neutral, with a 12-month price target of $37.</p>
<p>-- in a note, said identified a &quot;positive shift&quot; in Texas regulation.</p>
<p>-- said rate settlement possible over next six months.</p>
<p>-- said potential catalyst for stock's outperformance is the close of merger with ENSERCH Corp.</p>
<p>-- Texas Utilities closed Monday at 33-11/16.</p>
</text>
